<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sun Micro said raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber upgraded Sun Microsystems Inc to buy from neutral, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Stephen Smith not available to confirm or comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/2 to 33.</p>
</text>
